      "name": "Caravan Passage",
      "rawName": "Region7",
      "discoveredText": "Learn from the Caravans crossing this passage. I heard a woman is ruling the <style=MC>Fatimid Empire</style>. What a suprise indeed! Making me think of Maria Komnene, but that is for different story.",
