      "name": "Zerzura's Secret",
      "rawName": "Region10",
      "discoveredText": "We have found the hidden oasis of <style=MC>Zerzura</style> , a legendary place often spoken of in hushed tones. Its existence was a mystery that eluded many, much like the <style=MC>Holy Grail</style> I have sought in my own quests.",
      "acquiredText": "The holy secret mentioned in the scrolls must be <style=MC>Zerzura</style>, but it's only ruins now, long lost in the desert. This is not the way to the <style=MC>Holy Land</style> I was hoping for. At least, I met someone important.",
