      "name": "Raqqada City",
      "rawName": "Region25",
      "discoveredText": "Some say, in Raqqada lied the origin of the <style=MC>Fatimid Caliphate</style>, as the founder of our dynasty settled here. It served as royal residence before and still is of strategic importance.",
      "acquiredText": "Of course I belief in the Islam, the <style=MC>Fatimid Dynasty</style> counts back to the prophet himself! The world is full of different religions though and all were tolerated in our history. ",
