      "name": "Illyria",
      "rawName": "Region10",
      "discoveredText": "My title, <style=MC>Lionheart</style>, was given to me for my valor when I defeated Saladin's forces. My knights gave me a golden crown on the field. I promised them a double ration of wine for every enemy standard captured.",
      "acquiredText": "After my victory over Saladin's army, I diverted my campaign and negotiated with him in person. We came to an agreement eventually. I hope that you and I can negotiate, too?",
